# 2026-11-15: a GoTo switches the profile to the target's own, making
# one when there is none. On the rig a GoTo to Vega kept Jupiter's
# profile, so the status bar said [Jupiter] with the scope on Vega.
# The sandbox has its own profiles folder: nothing here touches the real one.
name    Profile follows the target
timeout 120

expect 30 Started -- EMULATOR
wait   3
goto   Vega
expect 15 [PROFILE] Created 'vega.ini' for 'Vega' from the Star profile
expect 15 Auto-loading 'Vega' profile
expect 15 Panel synced
wait   2
shot   vega
goto   Jupiter
expect 15 Auto-loading 'Jupiter' profile
absent 3  [PROFILE] Created
goto   Vega
expect 15 Auto-loading 'Vega' profile
absent 3  [PROFILE] Created
